---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Page id="xr" heading="XR Lab" facts={[
  ['Role', 'Graduate assistant'],
  ['Where', 'Virtual Experiences Lab and College of Pharmacy, UGA'],
  ['When', 'June 2025 – present'],
  ['Tools', 'SAM 3D, Meta Quest 3, VR/AR'],
]}>
  <Fragment slot="lede">
    <p>
      Since June 2025 I've been a graduate assistant on immersive technology for healthcare education
      at the University of Georgia: building VR software at the Virtual Experiences Lab, and keeping
      the College of Pharmacy's headsets in students' hands.
    </p>
  </Fragment>

  {/* Screenshots or clips go here. Put files in public/xr/ and add:
      <figure class="wide shot"><img src="/xr/patient.png" alt="..." width="1600" height="1000" /><figcaption>...</figcaption></figure> */}

  <section class="sec">
    <h2>Digital patient</h2>
    <div class="sec-body">
      <p>
        At the Virtual Experiences Lab I develop an interactive digital-patient module: the user
        assesses a simulated patient and works toward a diagnosis.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec">
    <h2>Markerless motion capture</h2>
    <div class="sec-body">
      <p>
        I built a motion-capture workflow on SAM 3D that reconstructs human movement in a virtual
        environment, with no markers on the performer.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec">
    <h2>A classroom of headsets</h2>
    <div class="sec-body">
      <p>As Graduate Assistant for Immersive Technology at the College of Pharmacy (June 2025 – June 2026):</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Supported 900+ students and helped faculty adopt VR/AR tools through training resources,
          technical guides and hands-on assistance.</li>
        <li>Built a device-ID asset-tracking system to improve equipment inventory and accountability.</li>
        <li>Managed Meta Quest 3 maintenance, inventory, storage and classroom deployment.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>
